  "content": "\n\n<p>это дополнение к моду <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decorative Blocks</a>, добавляющее поддержку древесины из других модов&nbsp;<br>на данный момент поддерживаются:</p>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Endergetic<br></a>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-mushrooms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Mushrooms<br></a>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Environmental<br></strong></span></a>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bayou-blues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong> Bayou Blues<br></strong></span></a>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abundance\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Abundance</strong></span></a><br>в планах:<br>- BYG<br>- остальные деревья Atmospheric<br>- Outer End<br>- Infernal Expansion<br>- Twilight Forest<br>- World of Wonder<br>- Architect's Palette<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fevowas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/877960888559210536/877961555134791761/Evo_-_Minecraft_Graphic.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"388\"></a></p>",
